@baseUrl = http://localhost:5200

### 0. Health check (không cần header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Tạo project bằng alice, có thêm thành viên bob
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "name": "Project Alpha",
  "memberIds": ["bob"]
}

### 2. Liệt kê project của alice
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
X-User-Id: alice

### 3.1. Tạo task có assignee
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "title": "Task assigned to Bob",
  "assignee": "bob",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-20"
}

### 3.2. Tạo task không có assignee
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "title": "Task unassigned"
}

### 4. Liệt kê task
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks
X-User-Id: alice

### 5.1. Đổi status sang InProgress
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### 5.2. Đổi status sang Done
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "status": "Done"
}

### 6.1. Lỗi: thiếu X-User-Id -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### 6.2. Lỗi: mallory không phải thành viên đọc task -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks
X-User-Id: mallory

### 6.3. Lỗi: project không tồn tại -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/999/tasks
X-User-Id: alice

### 6.4. Lỗi: title rỗng -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "title": ""
}

### 6.5. Lỗi: assignee không phải thành viên -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "title": "Task for unknown user",
  "assignee": "mallory"
}

### 6.6. Lỗi: status Archived -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: alice

{
  "status": "Archived"
}
